<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edges down to 1.8340 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edges down to 1.8340 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.8340 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.8330 at the previous session.</p>
<p>					  March 20	   March 19</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8340	     1.8330</p>
<p> Volume traded			$1.99 mln	  $3.02 mln</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 226</p>
</text>
